00:36:26.120 --> 00:36:31.080
takes wisdom to know what grace and love look like. Sometimes this happens when there's relational

00:36:31.080 --> 00:36:36.980
conflict, right? There's multiple parties involved, and you have to consider, okay, how do I stop the

00:36:36.980 --> 00:36:41.620
hurt from spreading here, but at the same time, we need to give people second chances, and also we

00:36:41.620 --> 00:36:45.460
need to set boundaries here, but we don't want to push people away, right? What does that look like?

00:36:47.160 --> 00:36:52.720
I really believe that if you're in this situation, that's an opportunity for us, where we can

00:36:52.720 --> 00:36:58.600
really experience what it feels like to be filled with the Spirit of God. Now, it doesn't make the

00:36:58.600 --> 00:37:06.220
twice easy. It doesn't make the, you know, dealing with this easy, but I think it's an amazing

00:37:06.220 --> 00:37:12.860
feeling to feel like God is with us as we're walking through this hard situation with his

00:37:12.860 --> 00:37:26.580
wisdom and love. So pray to be filled by the Spirit. Let's pray as we close. God, sometimes life

00:37:26.580 --> 00:37:34.840
is complicated. Sometimes being in the church is complicated. And God, we know that you've called

00:37:34.840 --> 00:37:40.820
us all, you're calling us all back to this heart of love, this heart of sacrifice that you showed

00:37:40.820 --> 00:37:47.420
for us. But we also know, Lord, that there's wisdom involved in how we live that out in the church.

00:37:47.420 --> 00:37:54.620
God, so fill us with the Spirit. Help us to be people who have your wisdom and have your love.

00:37:55.760 --> 00:38:02.940
And help us, Lord, as we navigate these situations, Lord, to be people who deal with these things

00:38:02.940 --> 00:38:08.580
differently. That we can always make choices, even if we have to do something difficult. That we

00:38:08.580 --> 00:38:14.140
always have this heart of wanting to follow in your example more. God, you're our example. Jesus,

00:38:14.140 --> 00:38:19.460
what you did is our example, and we want to follow you. So help us to do that and fill us

00:38:19.460 --> 00:38:22.820
with your spirit. I pray this in your name. Amen.
